    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 1. Ingestion & Validation\n- `Webhook_TicketIntake`: Listens on POST `/support-ticket`\n- `Code_ValidateAndSanitize`: Validates 4 required fields and normalizes priority casing (e.g. `'urgent'` ➔ `'Urgent'`)\n- `IF_HasRequiredFields`: Gates execution and safely drops incomplete tickets",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-0013-sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky_Ingestion_Validation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔀 2. 4-Priority Routing & Fallback\n- `Switch_RouteByPriority`: Compares `ticket.priority` against:\n  - Low (Output 0)\n  - Medium (Output 1)\n  - High (Output 2)\n  - Urgent (Output 3)\n  - Fallback (Output 4 / Unrecognized)\nTailored email & queue payloads set for each desk.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-0014-sticky2",
      "name": "Sticky_Switch_Branches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 3. Convergence & Audit\n- `HTTP_MockDispatchNotification`: All 5 branches converge to dispatch to simulated support gateway\n- `Code_BuildRoutingAudit`: Formats standardized audit record with dispatchId, assignedQueue, and timestamp",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-0015-sticky3",
      "name": "Sticky_Convergence_Audit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1580,
        40
      ]
    }
